	(text "Design Notes (Task 52 - IOT_SENSOR_NODE):\n- TPS54302: 12V->5.0V (R3=100k||75pF, R4=13.5k -> 5.01V), EN UVLO divider 100k/22k (2.16V>1.30V), 100nF BOOT, 10uH inductor.\n- TLV1117-33: 5V->3.3V clean LDO with both OUTPUT_1 & OUTPUT_2 tied to +3V3, 10uF+100nF input/output caps.\n- STM32F103C8T6: 8MHz HSE + 32.768kHz LSE crystals, NRST RC, BOOT0/1 10k pull-downs, ferrite-filtered VDDA, PA11/PA12 CAN1, PA0 TEMP_ADC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 350.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "338b4400-bb84-477c-8044-33aef4c3b479")
	)
